    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "don't talk to me like i'm some stranger on a street corner, elias. i don't need a hotline, i need you to understand. look at this place... it's all dying. everything is just rotting away. why is it so wrong to want to go with it? to just... find peace in the dark instead of struggling for a light that isn't even there anymore?",
